      },
      "message": "test(2d): pin the 2D Offset, pocket and level ring output before the shared planner\n\nGoldens recorded on origin/main 138a592a1 (unchanged code):\noffset2d_rings_unchanged_by_the_shared_planner (dog-bone, 8 cases),\npocket_rings_unchanged_by_the_shared_planner,\nlevel_rings_unchanged_by_the_shared_planner (motion), and the heavy\nfig8_offset_rings_unchanged_by_the_shared_planner (app, 5 cases).\nAll green on the unchanged code.\n\nRefs #3750\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
